      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be so helpful for quest users since for some reason pc players have something against us for some reason and have created avatars specifically for crashing quest users it gets annoying when someone just joins to crash people it does happen I even have an idea of how this can be implemented.  When you leave a world or get offline the game adds the previous world instance to a new recent instance tab in the world section of the menu this allows you to go right back to the world you were in before you left the world or got offline this would update when you go to a new world and they would have to figure out how to make this happen when the game crashes and that could be difficult",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
