  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-06-29T12:49:47.445Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I hate it when VRC crashes and I try to re-join the same instance I was in. The only reliable way to re-join is if you were friends with someone in that instance. But, if you aren't yet friends with anyone in that instance, re-joining is very hard. Please add a feature  to re-join a specific world instance you were just in before you crashed.",
